URL:https://cbcs.be/event/volontairement-implique%c2%b7es-en-pauvrete-for
 mation-a-destination-des-benevoles/
DESCRIPTION:To better understand poverty and feel more comfortable relati
 ng to beneficiaries. Field experiences\, data\, and testimonies help ref
 ine everyone's understanding of precariousness. The day will include dis
 cussion sessions to: understand the mechanisms of impoverishment and the
  realities of poverty\; examine perceptions of poverty and their consequ
 ences\; decode difficult situations and identify action plans Practical 
 information: 📍PFV – Rue royale 11 – 1000 Brussels (1st floor – 
 Parc metro/tram) 📅Tuesday 13 October\nhttps://cbcs.be/event/volontair
 ement-implique%c2%b7es-en-pauvrete-formation-a-destination-des-benevoles
