DTSTAMP:20261003T190546Z
DTSTART:20261015T063000Z
DTEND:20261015T150000Z
SUMMARY:Article 23 - A Social State That Lives Up to Its Promise
LOCATION:Area 42\, Rue des Palais 46A\, Bruxelles\, 1030\, Belgique
URL:https://cbcs.be/event/article-23-un-etat-social-a-la-hauteur/
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 15 October 2026 – Area 42\, Schaerbeek. The Brusse
 ls social-health sector is under pressure. Unemployment reform\, budget 
 cuts in the French Community of Belgium\, food aid slashed in half\, vul
 nerability of the populations being served... The blows are mounting at 
 every level of government. And on the ground\, it's a double burden: mor
 e people to support\, fewer resources to do it with. These political cho
 ices are not inevitable. Alternatives exist. And the sector isn't just p
 assive: it innovates\, forms alliances\, reformulates\, and resists.\nht
 tps://cbcs.be/event/article-23-un-etat-social-a-la-hauteur/
CATEGORIES:CBCS (Brussels social sector agenda)\,Civic & Local Politics\,
 Activism
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT120M
DESCRIPTION:Article 23 - A Social State That Lives Up to Its Promise
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
