  Bruxelles
URL:https://www.meetup.com/brussels-meetup/events/316829161/
DESCRIPTION:✨ **Meet new people in Brussels every Friday evening!** Loo
 king to expand your social circle\, meet international people and enjoy 
 relaxed conversations in the heart of Brussels? Join **EuroMeet every Fr
 iday anytime from 18:30 until at least 22:30** at the **Quartier Leopold
  brasserie**\, located on Place du Luxembourg\, directly opposite the Eu
 ropean Parliament. Our meetup offers a friendly\, relaxed and internatio
 nal atmosphere where it is easy to talk and get to know people—without
  loud music or a chaotic party environment. . 🍻 Drinks\, food and din
 ner available 🌍 Internationals\, expats\, newcome\nhttps://www.meetup
 .com/brussels-meetup/events/316829161/
